entrance ivy-west 6.56 31.5 to=cottage-a name="A Cottage"
entrance rose-west 20.5 31.5 to=cottage-b name="A Cottage"
entrance shop-south 13.94 52.5 to=shop name="The Chandler's"
entrance awning-south 24.1 54.5 to=cottage-a name="A Cottage"
entrance ivy-south 56.56 54.5 to=cottage-b name="A Cottage"
entrance rose-south 73.5 52.5 to=cottage-a name="A Cottage"

; The Lantern Market: the Gilded Flagon, the quest board with Fennick by it, and the stalls.
